# exp-21 against the shipped 0014 on the game's own image creates: zero differing decisions

# Question: `exp-21` rewrites the rule of `0014` (the UBWC/tiling decision for a MUTABLE_FORMAT
#           image created without a VkImageFormatListCreateInfo) as one decision function instead
#           of a special case in two callers. Its gate, queue 3 and journal 33.1, is "the same
#           decisions as `0014` on the game's creates" before it may become patch `0016`. The rig
#           half of that gate is results/test-exp21-equiv-p14.log; this file is the inventory half.
# Method:   two inventories of the same game, one scene load, read by three counters.
#           Total-level (scripts/imginv-stats.py), class-level (scripts/imginv-classes.py) and
#           per-create (scripts/imginv-decisions.py, new with this run): two images with the same
#           create signature - format, view format, extent, mip/array/sample counts, usage, flags,
#           list length and list content - must agree in `tile=` and `ubwc=`. A create present in
#           one session and absent in the other is scene content, not a decision, so the three
#           levels are reported apart.
# Drivers:  A  results/raw/game-patched-imginv5.log, sha256 80d433927103ef02..., 976 648 B.
#             The reference column: the ship stack with `0014`, build `050375a18b7b` (journal 27).
#             Run 19.11 with MANGOHUD=1.
#           B1 results/raw/game-patched-exp21inv.log,  sha256 705d1219590a7f03..., 1 199 225 B.
#           B2 results/raw/game-patched-exp21inv2.log, sha256 926b4c625e8b..., 2 239 493 B.
#             Both: build/out-exp21/libvulkan_freedreno.so, sha256 d49d094a8d6e...
#             (`0001..0013` + exp-14 + exp-21, `0014` not applied). B1 was run without the
#             overlay, B2 with MANGOHUD=1 as the reference run had it; the difference between
#             B1 and B2 is section 4.
# Runs:     21.11, RE4 (DX12, proton-cachyos) 170 s each, exit 124 by design - the runner kills
#           the game at the timeout so that the next run cannot start on top of this one.
# Command:  source scripts/env.sh && MANGOHUD=1 TU_IMG_INV=1 TAG=<exp21inv2> \
#               ICD=/var/home/armada/opencode/build/out-exp21/freedreno_icd.json \
#               scripts/run-game.sh patched 170
# Counters: python3 scripts/imginv-stats.py     results/raw/game-patched-{imginv5,exp21inv2}.log
#           python3 scripts/imginv-classes.py   results/raw/game-patched-{imginv5,exp21inv2}.log
#           python3 scripts/imginv-decisions.py results/raw/game-patched-{imginv5,exp21inv2}.log
#           (results/raw/ is gitignored: full proton stdout/stderr; the counters' output is this
#           file, and the game log lines are truncated by interleaved wine/vkd3d stderr - the
#           counters count those lines and skip them, they do not guess at them)

